  <article class="doc">
    <p class="kick">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="h1">Privacy Policy for Bulletin</h1>
    <p class="doc-updated">Last updated: January 5, 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>Bulletin is committed to protecting your privacy. This privacy policy explains our data practices for the Bulletin RSS feed reader application.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Data collection</h2>
      <p><strong>We do not collect any data.</strong> Bulletin does not collect, store, transmit, or process any personal information or usage data from our users. We have no servers, no analytics, and no tracking.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your Miniflux server</h2>
      <p>Bulletin connects directly to your self-hosted Miniflux server using credentials you provide. All communication occurs directly between your device and your server. We do not have access to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your Miniflux server URL or credentials</li>
        <li>Your feed subscriptions or content</li>
        <li>Your reading history or preferences</li>
        <li>Any data stored on your Miniflux server</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local data storage</h2>
      <p>All data in Bulletin is stored locally on your device, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your Miniflux server connection details</li>
        <li>Your reading preferences, themes, and settings</li>
        <li>Feed content cached for offline reading</li>
        <li>Your Read Later list and reading progress</li>
        <li>Feed filtering rules (blocklists and keeplists)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Third-party content</h2>
      <p>When you browse feeds, Bulletin may fetch images and content from third-party websites referenced in your feeds. These connections are made directly between your device and the content providers.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Analytics and tracking</h2>
      <p>Bulletin does not use any analytics, tracking, or advertising services. We do not track your usage, behavior, or any other metrics. There are no third-party SDKs in the app.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Data sharing</h2>
      <p>Since we do not collect any data, we do not share, sell, or transfer any data to third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Bulletin does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <strong><a href="mailto:support@cosmique.io">support@cosmique.io</a></strong>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p><em>Bulletin is developed independently and is not affiliated with Miniflux or any RSS feed providers.</em></p>
    </section>

